# GAMEPLAY-PROOF (GP1): one Play of GameplayProof.desce proves input remapping, walk/jump/crouch with the Spring Arm camera, death and restart, a trigger button opening a door, and the gameplay debugger opened by its key.
# The level: DefaultPawn = Prefabs/Pawn_Player.deprefab (Character Controller + Enhanced Input IMC_Default + PlayerController.lua, Spring Arm 450 cm with the player camera), PlayerStart (0, 92, 650), RespawnDelay 1 s;
# Button = a Trigger pad z [-170, 130] running ButtonOpensDoor.lua (Door at x = 260 rises 250 cm); KillZone = a Trigger pad x [-450, -150], z [100, 600] running KillZone.lua (gameMode.kill);
# GameplayProof.lua maps IA_Jump Space -> J once the pawn's context is active, gives Space back the first time the jump starts, and labels the pawn / binding / death / door over the picture.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/GameplayProof.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Когда run Action "Play"
Когда advance 0.5
# [1_input_remap] J is IA_Jump's key now.
Когда input keydown - - j
Когда advance 0.1
Когда input keyup - - j
Когда advance 0.2
Тогда-вид 1_input_remap green line "IA_Jump started by J (new key J down, default Space up)"; the white line reads "IN THE AIR"; the view is the Spring Arm camera behind and above the capsule
Когда advance 1.5
# [2_move_jump] walk forward 0.5 s, stop, jump with Space (the default key is back), shot on the way up.
Когда input keydown - - w
Когда advance 0.5
Когда input keyup - - w
Когда advance 0.4
Когда input keydown - - space
Когда advance 0.1
Когда input keyup - - space
Когда advance 0.25
Тогда-вид 2_move_jump the pawn line reads z well below the start's 650 and "IN THE AIR"; the camera kept its place behind the capsule (Spring Arm), the button pad ahead and the door to the right
Когда advance 1.5
Когда input keydown - - c
Когда advance 0.3
Тогда-вид 2b_crouch the pawn line ends ", CROUCHED"; the camera sits lower than in 2_move_jump
Когда input keyup - - c
Когда advance 0.3
# [3_respawn] strafe left into the kill zone: death, then RestartPlayer after 1 s at the PlayerStart.
Когда input keydown - - a
Когда advance 0.8
Когда input keyup - - a
Тогда-вид 3a_died the amber line "died at (x < -100, ...), deaths 1"; the view stays on the dead capsule
Когда advance 1.5
Тогда-вид 3_respawn the amber line "restarted at PlayerStart (0, 92, 650), deaths 1, restarts 1"; the pawn line reads about (0, 92, 650) "on ground"
# [4_door] walk forward onto the button pad: the door rises.
Когда input keydown - - w
Когда advance 1.0
Когда input keyup - - w
Когда advance 1.5
Тогда-вид 4_door the amber label over the door reads "door OPEN (+250 cm)"; the door slab stands 250 cm higher than its closed place on the right; the pawn stands on the pad
# [5_gdt] the gameplay debugger's key (`) opens its panel; the Cube is selected as its target.
Когда input key - - grave
Когда advance 0.2
Когда select 6018453462564557835
Когда advance 0.5
Тогда-вид 5_gdt the gameplay debugger panel at the top-left names Cube with its categories "1 Basic [on] 2 Physics [on] 3 Script [on] 4 Rendering [on]"; 0 VUID in editor.log
